s her character grows we aren't quite  sure whether cruella is joking anymore  about the violent things she says  they really would make fabulous coats  the dogs or here's one of my favorites  and she's a homicidal maniac and you're  not  we don't know that yet i'm still young  just like how the joker embraces his  alter ego so too does cruella  and even society in joker arthur's  actions lead him to become a symbol  raging against the establishment the  same is true in cruella where as the  baroness symbolizes the establishment  cruella represents a new vanguard trying  to seize control by any means necessary  and joker is seen by some as a hero  and others as a villain just like  cruella is seen as a designer by some  and a vandal by others heck they even  say this outright in the film  some call her a designer  both characters embrace being symbols  joker at the very end as he's embraced  by the rioters and cruella as she's  recruiting for her  final heist but people do need a villain  to believe in so i'm happy to fit the  bill  the rift between upper and lower class  is paralleled in each film as well take  a look at the poverty-filled world of  arthur and estella  in comparison to the luxury of thomas  wayne and the baroness  each character has to suppress their  submissive sides in order for their  alter ego to fully manifest arthur is a  total pushover but  joker is an alpha estella is a pushover  and cruella is an alpha  cruella gets things done stella does not  as we reach the end of cruella just like  what happens near the end in joker our  characters  fully embrace these egos  [Music]  one small thing yeah when you bring me  out  can you introduce me as joker listen to  these lines in cruella which could  easily suit the joker  mustache much to avenge revenge and  destroy  gorilla and joker are also similar in  their chosen career paths  both are struggling artists arthur a  stand-up comic and estella an emerging  fashion designer both of them keep  notepads arthur ford's jokes and estella  for her designs the difference here is  that arthur really doesn't have any  talent  but don't tell them i said that each of  them have another person in their  industry they're obsessed with albeit  for different reasons arthur loves the  comedian late night host murray and even  fantasizes about being on his show  a fantasy that comes to reality in the  film's bloody climax  estella is obsessed with the baroness  eventually landing a job as a designer  assistant she has a whole wall filled  with news about her and her designs  even the climax of the films are similar  when you think about it both involve a  tragic incident involving the main  characters with an  audience watching in joker it's on  murray's live show in cruella it's at  her estate with all the party guests  watching  and yes both characters evade the police  over the course of their respective  films  in cruella in order to fit in she has  managed to get all the dinner guests to  dress up just like her  much like in joker when the rioters dawn  clown masks just like joker cruella and  joker also have similar looks and  mannerisms when estella turns into  cruella she dons white makeup just like  joker does the two even have their own  iconic laughs  [Laughter]  arthur is also a big smoker just like  the original cruella is in the 1961  animated movie  101 dalmatians however they took that  out because disney doesn't like to have  smoking in their movies  each film also ends up tying in to other  films in their respective franchises  leaving room for potential sequels  in joker we see young bruce wayne in the  alleyway with his  murdered parents the night of the gotham  riots in corello we see roger anita  giving dalmatian puppies as gifts  pongo and perdita respectively which is  a tie into the events of 101 dalmatians  the baroness also states that she'll be  back as she gets carted away to prison  leaving the potential for another sequel  joker is seen with bloody footprints  implying that he killed his therapist  escaping the mental institution and we  already know that a joke or two is in  the works  and just for fun we have a similarity  speed round of a bunch of things i found  similar that i couldn't quite weave into  this main narrative a shot of dying your  hair in the mirror to signify your  character changing  joker and cruella both being fashion  icons each film's reliance on newspaper  titles giving out exposition  gala events where our characters are not  allowed committing crimes on public  transit although these two films share  many similarities i gotta say they  are two different films in fact if  someone hadn't mentioned the two being  similar i probably wouldn't have even  thought twice of connecting the two but  i wanna know what you guys think in the  comments below will cruella inspire a  wave of dalmatian kidnappings or is this  all just a bunch of hot air thanks for  watching everyone please make sure to  like and subscribe it really helps the  channel out and be sure to check out my  other comparison videos  for more bad takes you can follow me on  twitter and instagram at thingstoryt  until next time remember daddy loves you  very much

